":guilabel:`Size`: Nastavite število izdelkov, prikazanih na stran in vrstico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/products.rst:74
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Style`: "
"Select :guilabel:`Default`, :guilabel:`Cards`, :guilabel:`Thumbnails`, "
