#: ../../content/applications/websites/ecommerce/products.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Sort`: Choose how products are sorted by "
"default: :guilabel:`Featured`, :guilabel:`Newest Arrivals`, :guilabel:`Name "
"(A-Z)`, :guilabel:`Price - Low to High`, or :guilabel:`Price - High to Low`."
