#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:3
msgid "Commands and canned responses"
msgstr "Ukazi in vnaprej pripravljeni odgovori"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:5
msgid ""
"In the Odoo **Live Chat** application, *commands* allow the user to perform "
"specific actions both inside the chat window, and through other Odoo "
"applications. The **Live Chat** app also includes *canned responses*. These "
"are customized, preconfigured substitutions that allow users to replace "
"shortcut entries in place of longer, well-thought out responses to some of "
"the most common questions and comments."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji Odoo **Neposredni klepet** *ukazi* uporabniku omogočajo "
"izvajanje določenih dejanj tako v oknu klepeta kot prek drugih aplikacij "
"Odoo. Aplikacija **Neposredni klepet** vključuje tudi *vnaprej pripravljene "
"odgovore*. To so prilagojene, vnaprej konfigurirane zamenjave, ki "
"uporabnikom omogočajo, da bližnjice nadomestijo z daljšimi, dobro "
"premišljenimi odgovori na nekatera najpogostejša vprašanja in komentarje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:11
msgid ""
"Both commands and canned responses save time, and allow users to maintain a "
"level of consistency throughout their conversations."
msgstr ""
"Tako ukazi kot vnaprej pripravljeni odgovori prihranijo čas in uporabnikom "
"omogočajo ohranjanje doslednosti v svojih pogovorih."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:15
msgid "Execute a command"
msgstr "Izvedi ukaz"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:17
msgid ""
"Live chat *commands* are keywords that trigger preconfigured actions. When a "
"live chat *operator* is participating in a conversation with a customer or "
"website visitor, they can execute a command by typing `/`, followed by the "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Ukazi za klepet v živo (*commands*) so ključne besede, ki sprožijo vnaprej "
"nastavljena dejanja. Ko operater klepeta v živo (*operator*) sodeluje v "
"pogovoru s stranko ali obiskovalcem spletnega mesta, lahko izvrši ukaz tako, "
"da vnese `/`, ki mu sledi ukaz."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:21
msgid ""
"Commands, and the resulting actions, are only visible in the conversation "
"window for the live chat operator. A customer does not see any commands that "
"an operator uses in a conversation from their view of the chat."
msgstr ""
"Ukazi in dejanja, ki iz njih izhajajo, so vidni samo v oknu pogovora za "
"operaterja klepeta v živo. Stranka ne vidi nobenih ukazov, ki jih operater "
"uporablja v pogovoru iz svojega pogleda na klepet."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:26
msgid ""
"During a conversation with a customer, a live chat operator executes the "
"command to :ref:`create a ticket <live-chat/ticket>`. After entering the "
"command, `/ticket`, the system automatically creates a ticket with the "
"information from the conversation. It also includes a link to the new "
"ticket, so the operator can go there directly to add any additional "
"information, if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Med pogovorom s stranko operater klepeta v živo izvrši ukaz "
"za :ref:`ustvarjanje zahtevka <live-chat/ticket>`. Po vnosu ukaza `/ticket` "
"sistem samodejno ustvari zahtevek z informacijami iz pogovora. Vključuje "
"tudi povezavo do novega zahtevka, tako da lahko operater neposredno odpre ta "
"zahtevek in po potrebi doda dodatne informacije."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:35
msgid "More information about each available command can be found below."
msgstr "Več informacij o vsakem razpoložljivem ukazu je na voljo spodaj."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:38
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Pomoč"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:40
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/help` in the chat window, an informative message that "
"includes the potential entry types an operator can make is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Če operater vnese `/help` v okno za klepet, se prikaže informativno "
"sporočilo, ki vključuje morebitne vrste vnosov, ki jih lahko operater opravi."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:43
msgid ""
"Type `@username` to mention a user in the conversation. A notification will "
"be sent to that user's inbox or email, depending on their notification "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite `@uporabniškoime`, da omenite uporabnika v pogovoru. Obvestilo bo "
"poslano v prečalni predal tega uporabnika ali po e-pošti, odvisno od "
"njihovih nastavitev obvestil."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:45
msgid "Type `/command` to execute a command."
msgstr "Vnesite `/ukaz`, da izvršite ukaz."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:46
msgid ""
"Type `:shortcut` to insert a :ref:`canned response <live-chat/canned-"
"responses>`."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite `:bližnjica`, da vstavite :ref:`vnaprej pripravljeni odgovor <live-"
"chat/canned-responses>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:49
msgid ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:50
msgid ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/productivity/discuss/team_communication`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:53
msgid "Ticket & search tickets"
msgstr "Zahtevek in iskanje zahtevkov"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:55
msgid ""
"The `/ticket` and `/search_tickets` commands allow operators to create "
"helpdesk tickets directly from a conversation, and search through existing "
"tickets by keyword or ticket number."
msgstr ""
"Ukaza `/ticket` in `/search_tickets` omogočata operaterjem, da ustvarijo "
"zahtevke službe za pomoč neposredno iz pogovora in iščejo po obstoječih "
"zahtevkih po ključni besedi ali številki zahtevka."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:59
msgid ""
"The `/ticket` and `/search_tickets` commands can **only** be used if the "
"**Helpdesk** app has been installed, and *Live Chat* has been activated on a "
"*Helpdesk* team. To activate *Live Chat*, go to :menuselection:`Helpdesk app "
"--> Configuration --> Helpdesk Teams`, and select a team. Scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Channels` section, and check the box labeled, :guilabel:`Live "
"Chat`."
msgstr ""
"Ukaza `/ticket` in `/search_tickets` se lahko uporabljata **samo**, če je "
"aplikacija **Služba za pomoč** nameščena in je *Klepet v živo* aktiviran v "
"ekipi *Službe za pomoč*. Za aktivacijo *Klepeta v živo* pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Služba za pomoč --> Nastavitve --> Ekipe "
"službe za pomoč` in izberite ekipo. Pomaknite se do "
"odseka :guilabel:`Kanali` in označite polje z oznakoijo :guilabel:`Klepet v "
"živo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:67
msgid "Create a ticket from a live chat"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje zahtevka iz klepeta v živo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:69
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/ticket` in the chat window, the conversation is used "
"to create a *Helpdesk* ticket."
msgstr ""
"Če operater vnese `/ticket` v okno za klepet, se pogovor uporabi za "
"ustvarjanje zahtevka *Službe za pomoč*."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:72
msgid ""
"After entering the `/ticket` command, type a title for the ticket into the "
"chat window, then press `Enter`."
msgstr ""
"Po vnosu ukaza `/ticket` vnesite naslov zahtevka v okno za klepet in "
"pritisnite `Enter`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:None
msgid "View of the results from a helpdesk search in a Live Chat conversation."
msgstr "Pogled rezultatov iskanja službe za pomoč v pogovoru klepeta v živo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:79
msgid ""
"The newly created ticket will be added to the *Helpdesk* team that has live "
"chat enabled. If more than one team has live chat enabled, the ticket will "
"automatically be assigned based on the team's priority."
msgstr ""
"Novo ustvarjen zahtevek bo dodan ekipi *Službe za pomoč*, ki ima omogočen "
"klepet v živo. Če ima več ekip omogočen klepet v živo, bo zahtevek samodejno "
"dodeljen glede na prednost ekipe."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:83
msgid ""
"The transcript from the conversation will be added to the new ticket, under "
"the :guilabel:`Description` tab."
msgstr ""
"Prepis pogovora bo dodan novemu zahtevku pod zavihkom :guilabel:`Opis`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:86
msgid ""
"To access the new ticket, click on the link in the chat window, or go to "
"the :menuselection:`Helpdesk app` and click the :guilabel:`Tickets` button "
"on the Kanban card for the appropriate team."
msgstr ""
"Za dostop do novega zahtevka kliknite povezavo v oknu za klepet ali pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Aplikacija Služba za pomoč` in kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Zahtevki` na Kanban kartici ustrezne ekipe."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:91
msgid "Search for a ticket from a live chat"
msgstr "Iskanje zahtevka iz neposrednega klepeta"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:93
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/search_tickets` in the chat window, they can search "
"through *Helpdesk* tickets, either by ticket number or keyword."
msgstr ""
"Če operater vpiše `/search_tickets` v okno za klepet, lahko išče po "
"zahtevkih *Službe za pomoč*, bodisi po številki zahtevka bodisi po ključni "
"besedi."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:96
msgid ""
"After entering the `/search_tickets` command, type a keyword or ticket "
"number, then press :kbd:`Enter`. If one or more related tickets are found, a "
"list of links is generated in the conversation window."
msgstr ""
"Po vnosu ukaza `/search_tickets` vnesite ključno besedo ali številko "
"zahtevka, nato pritisnite :kbd:`Enter`. Če je najden en ali več povezanih "
"zahtevkov, se v oknu pogovora ustvari seznam povezav."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:105
msgid ""
"Results from the search command will only be seen by the operator, not the "
"customer."
msgstr "Rezultate iskalnega ukaza bo videl samo operater, ne stranka."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:108
msgid "History"
msgstr "Zgodovina"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:110
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/history` in the chat window, it generates a list of "
"the most recent pages the visitor has viewed on the website (up to 15)."
msgstr ""
"Če operater vpiše `/history` v okno za klepet, se ustvari seznam najnovejših "
"strani, ki si jih je obiskovalec ogledal na spletnem mestu (do 15)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:None
msgid ""
"View of the results from a /history command in a Live Chat conversation."
msgstr "Pogled rezultatov ukaza /history v pogovoru neposrednega klepeta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:118
msgid "Lead"
msgstr "Indic"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:120
msgid ""
"By typing `/lead` in the chat window, an operator can create a *lead* in the "
"**CRM** application."
msgstr ""
"Z vpisom `/lead` v okno za klepet lahko operater ustvari *priložnost* v "
"aplikaciji **CRM**."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:None
msgid "View of the results from a /lead command in a Live Chat conversation."
msgstr "Pogled rezultatov ukaza /lead v pogovoru neposrednega klepeta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:127
msgid ""
"The `/lead` command can only be used if the **CRM** app has been installed."
msgstr ""
"Ukaz `/lead` je mogoče uporabiti le, če je aplikacija **CRM** nameščena."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:129
msgid ""
"After typing `/lead`, create a title for this new lead, then press `Enter`. "
"A link with the lead title appears. Click the link, or navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`CRM` app to view the :guilabel:`Pipeline`."
msgstr ""
"Po vnosu `/lead` ustvarite naslov za to novo priložnost, nato pritisnite "
"`Enter`. Prikaže se povezava z naslovom priložnosti. Kliknite povezavo ali "
"pojdite v aplikacijo :menuselection:`CRM`, da si ogledate :guilabel:`Potek`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:134
msgid ""
"The link to the new lead can only be seen and accessed by the operator, not "
"the customer."
msgstr ""
"Povezavo do nove priložnosti lahko vidi in odpre samo operater, ne stranka."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:136
msgid ""
"The transcript of that specific live chat conversation (where the lead was "
"created) is added to the :guilabel:`Internal Notes` tab of the lead form."
msgstr ""
"Zapis tega določenega pogovora v neposrednem klepetu (kjer je bila "
"priložnost ustvarjena) je dodan na zavihek :guilabel:`Notranja opomba` "
"obrazca priložnosti."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:139
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Extra Information` tab of the lead form, "
"the :guilabel:`Source` will be listed as :guilabel:`Livechat`."
msgstr ""
"Na zavihku :guilabel:`Dodatne informacije` obrazca priložnosti "
"bo :guilabel:`Vir` naveden kot :guilabel:`Livechat`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:143
msgid "Leave"
msgstr "Zapusti"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:145
msgid ""
"If an operator types `/leave` in the chat window, they can automatically "
"exit the conversation. This command does not cause the customer to be "
"removed from the conversation, nor does it automatically end the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"Če operater vpiše `/leave` v okno za klepet, lahko samodejno zapusti "
"pogovor. Ta ukaz ne povzroči odstranitve stranke iz pogovora in tudi ne "
"konča pogovora samodejno."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:150
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/crm/acquire_leads`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:151
msgid ":doc:`../../services/helpdesk`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../services/helpdesk`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:156
msgid "Canned responses"
msgstr "Vnaprej pripravljeni odgovori"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:158
msgid ""
"*Canned responses* are customizable inputs where a *shortcut* stands in for "
"a longer response. An operator will enter the shortcut, and it is "
"automatically replaced by the expanded *substitution* response in the "
"conversation."
msgstr ""
"*Predpripravljeni odgovori* so prilagodljivi vnosi, kjer *bližnjica* "
"nadomesti daljši odgovor. Operater vnese bližnjico in ta se v pogovoru "
"samodejno nadomesti z razširjenim *nadomestitvenim* odgovorom."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:163
msgid "Create canned responses"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje predpripravljenih odgovorov"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:165
msgid ""
"To create a new canned response, go to :menuselection:`Live Chat app --> "
"Configuration --> Canned Responses --> New`."
msgstr ""
"Za ustvarjanje novega predpripravljenega odgovora pojdite "
"v :menuselection:`Aplikacija Neposredni klepet --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Predpripravljeni odgovori --> Novo`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:168
msgid ""
"Type a shortcut command in the :guilabel:`Shortcut` field. Next, click "
"the :guilabel:`Substitution` field, and type the message that should replace "
"the shortcut."
msgstr ""
"V polje :guilabel:`Bližnjica` vnesite ukaz za bližnjico. Nato kliknite v "
"polje :guilabel:`Nadomestitev` in vnesite sporočilo, ki naj nadomesti "
"bližnjico."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:172
msgid ""
"Try to connect the shortcut to the topic of the substitution. The easier it "
"is for the operators to remember, the easier it is to use the canned "
"responses in conversations."
msgstr ""
"Poskusite povezati bližnjico s temo nadomestitve. Lažje kot si operaterji "
"zapomnijo bližnjico, lažje je uporabiti pripravljene odgovore v pogovorih."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:176
msgid "Use canned responses in a live chat conversation"
msgstr "Uporaba pripravljenih odgovorov v pogovoru v živo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:178
msgid ""
"To use a canned response during a live chat conversation, type a colon (`:`) "
"into the chat window, followed by the shortcut."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:182
msgid ""
"An operator is chatting with a visitor. As soon as they type `:` they would "
"see a list of available responses. They can manually select one from the "
"list, or continue to type. If they want to use the canned response `'I am "
"sorry to hear that.'`, they would type `:sorry`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:None
msgid ""
"View of a chat window and the use of a canned response in Odoo Live Chat."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:191
msgid ""
"Typing `:` into a chat window on its own will generate a list of available "
"canned responses. Responses can be manually selected from the list, in "
"addition to the use of shortcuts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/livechat/responses.rst:0
msgid "View of a chat window and the list of available canned responses."
msgstr "Pogled okna klepeta in seznam razpoložljivih pripravljenih odgovorov."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:7
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Spletna stran"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Odoo Website** offers a user-friendly platform for creating and managing "
"your website. It includes various tools and features to help you design, "
"publish, and maintain web pages without needing advanced technical skills. "
"You can easily customize layouts, add multimedia content, and integrate with "
"other Odoo apps to expand your website's functionality."
msgstr ""
"**Odoo Website** ponuja uporabniku prijazen vmesnik za ustvarjanje in "
"upravljanje vaše spletne strani. Vključuje različna orodja in funkcije, ki "
"vam pomagajo pri oblikovanju, objavljanju in vzdrževanju spletnih strani "
"brez potrebe po naprednih tehničnih znanjih. Lahko zlahka prilagodite "
"postavitve, dodate večpredstavnostno vsebino in integrirate z drugimi "
"aplikacijami Odoo za razširitev funkcionalnosti vaše spletne strani."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:16
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/web_design.rst:5
msgid "Web design"
msgstr "Spletno oblikovanje"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:16
msgid "Design your website using building blocks and website themes."
msgstr "Oblikujte svojo spletno stran z gradniki in temami za spletne strani."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:22
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/pages.rst:5
msgid "Pages"
msgstr "Strani"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:22
msgid "Manage website pages, menus, and search engine optimization."
msgstr "Upravljajte spletne strani, menije in optimizacijo za iskalnike."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:28
msgid ""
"Configure domain names, address autocompletion, Google Search Console, "
"cookies bar, translations, multiple websites, form spam protection, content "
"delivery network (CDN)."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte domenska imena, samodokončanje naslova, Google Search "
"Console, vrstico za piškotke, prevode, več spletnih mest, zaščito pred "
"neželeno pošto obrazcev, omrežje za dostavo vsebine (CDN)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:35
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:144
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/reporting.rst:5
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "Poročanje"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:35
msgid ""
"Monitor your website's traffic with website analytics and set up link "
"trackers."
msgstr ""
"Spremljajte promet na svoji spletni strani z analitiko spletnega mesta in "
"nastavite sledilce povezav."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:40
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/mail_groups.rst:3
msgid "Mail groups"
msgstr "Poštne skupine"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:40
msgid ""
"Configure mail groups to allow website visitors to participate in public "
"discussions via email."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirajte poštne skupine, da bodo obiskovalci spletnega mesta lahko "
"sodelovali v javnih razpravah prek e-pošte."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website.rst:54
msgid ":doc:`../general/integrations/unsplash`"
msgstr ":doc:`../general/integrations/unsplash`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:3
msgid "Address autocomplete"
msgstr "Samodokončanje naslova"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:5
msgid ""
"You can use the Google Places API on your website to ensure that your users' "
"delivery addresses exist and are understood by the carrier. The Google "
"Places API allows developers to access detailed information about places "
"using HTTP requests. The autocompletion predicts a list of places when the "
"user starts typing the address."
msgstr ""
"Na svoji spletni strani lahko uporabite API Google Places, da zagotovite, da "
"dostavni naslovi vaših uporabnikov obstajajo in jih razume prevoznik. API "
"Google Places razvijalcem omogoča dostop do podrobnih informacij o krajih "
"prek zahtev HTTP. Samodejno dokončanje napoveduje seznam krajev, ko "
"uporabnik začne vnašati naslov."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:None
msgid "Address autocomplete example"
msgstr "Primer samodejnega dokončanja naslova"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:14
msgid "`Google Maps Platform <https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-products>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Maps Platform <https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-products>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:15
msgid ""
"`Google Developers Documentation: Google Places API <https://"
"developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/autocomplete>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Dokumentacija za razvijalce Google: API Google Places <https://"
"developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/autocomplete>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:18
msgid ""
"To do so, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"enable :guilabel:`Address Autocomplete` in the :guilabel:`SEO` section."
msgstr ""
"Za to pojdite na :menuselection:`Spletna stran --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve` in omogočite :guilabel:`Samodejno dokončanje naslova` v "
"razdelku :guilabel:`SEO`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:None
msgid "Enable address autocomplete"
msgstr "Omogoči samodejno dokončanje naslova"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:24
msgid ""
"Insert your :guilabel:`Google Places API key` in the :guilabel:`API Key` "
"field. If you don't have one, create yours on the `Google Cloud Console "
"<https://console.cloud.google.com/getting-started>`_ and follow these steps."
msgstr ""
"V polje :guilabel:`API Key` vstavite svoj :guilabel:`Google Places API key`. "
"Če ga nimate, ga ustvarite na `Google Cloud Console <https://"
"console.cloud.google.com/getting-started>`_ in sledite tem korakom."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:31
msgid "Step 1: Enable the Google Places API"
msgstr "Korak 1: Omogočite Google Places API"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Create a New Project:** To enable the **Google Places API**, you first "
"need to create a project. To do so, click :guilabel:`Select a project` in "
"the top left corner, :guilabel:`New Project`, and follow the prompts to set "
"up your project."
msgstr ""
"**Ustvarite nov projekt:** Za omogočitev **Google Places API** morate "
"najprej ustvariti projekt. To storite tako, da v zgornjem levem kotu "
"kliknete :guilabel:`Select a project`, nato :guilabel:`New Project` in "
"sledite navodilom za nastavitev projekta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Enable the Google Places API:** Go to the :guilabel:`Enabled APIs & "
"Services` and click :guilabel:`+ ENABLE APIS AND SERVICES.` Search "
"for :guilabel:`\"Places API\"` and select it. Click on "
"the :guilabel:`\"Enable\"` button."
msgstr ""
"**Omogočite Google Places API:** Pojdite na :guilabel:`Enabled APIs & "
"Services` in kliknite :guilabel:`+ ENABLE APIS AND SERVICES.` "
"Poiščite :guilabel:`\"Places API\"` in ga izberite. Kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`\"Enable\"`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:43
msgid ""
"Google's pricing depends on the number of requests and their complexity."
msgstr ""
"Googlova cenovna politika je odvisna od števila zahtev in njihove "
"kompleksnosti."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:46
msgid "Step 2: Create API Credentials"
msgstr "Korak 2: Ustvarite API poverilnice"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:48
msgid ""
"Go to `APIs & Services --> Credentials <https://console.cloud.google.com/"
"apis/credentials>`_."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na `APIs & Services --> Credentials <https://"
"console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Create credentials:** To create your credentials, go "
"to :guilabel:`Credentials`, click :guilabel:`Create Credentials`, and "
"select :guilabel:`API key`."
msgstr ""
"**Ustvarite poverilnice:** Za ustvarjanje poverilnic pojdite "
"na :guilabel:`Credentials`, kliknite :guilabel:`Create Credentials` in "
"izberite :guilabel:`API key`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:54
msgid "Restrict the API Key (Optional)"
msgstr "Omejite API ključ (izbirno)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:56
msgid ""
"For security purposes, you can restrict the usage of your API key. You can "
"go to the :guilabel:`API restrictions` section to specify which APIs your "
"key can access. For the Google Places API, you can restrict it to only allow "
"requests from specific websites or apps."
msgstr ""
"Iz varnostnih razlogov lahko omejite uporabo svojega API ključa. Lahko "
"greste v razdelek :guilabel:`API restrictions`, kjer določite, do katerih "
"API-jev ima vaš ključ dostop. Za Google Places API ga lahko omejite tako, da "
"dovoljuje zahteve samo z določenih spletnih strani ali aplikacij."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:61
msgid "Save Your API Key: copy your API key and securely store it."
msgstr ""
"Shranite svoj API ključ: kopirajte svoj API ključ in ga varno shranite."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/address_autocomplete.rst:62
msgid "Do not share it publicly or expose it in client-side code."
msgstr "Ne delite ga javno in ga ne izpostavljajte v kodi na strani odjemalca."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:3
msgid "Set up a content delivery network (CDN)"
msgstr "Nastavitev omrežja za dostavo vsebin (CDN)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:8
msgid "Deploying with KeyCDN"
msgstr "Uvajanje s KeyCDN"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:10
msgid ""
"A :abbr:`CDN (Content Delivery Network)` or *content distribution network*, "
"is a geographically distributed network of servers that provides high speed "
"internet content. The :abbr:`CDN (Content Delivery Network)` provides quick, "
"high-quality content delivery for content-heavy websites."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`CDN (omrežje za dostavo vsebin)` ali *omrežje za distribucijo vsebin* "
"je geografsko razpršeno omrežje strežnikov, ki zagotavlja internetno vsebino "
"visoke hitrosti. :abbr:`CDN (omrežje za dostavo vsebin)` zagotavlja hitro "
"dostavo vsebin visoke kakovosti za spletne strani z veliko vsebine."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:14
msgid ""
"This document will guide you through the setup of a KeyCDN_ account with an "
"Odoo powered website."
msgstr ""
"Ta dokument vas bo vodil skozi nastavitev računa KeyCDN_ za spletno stran, "
"ki deluje na platformi Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:17
msgid "Create a pull zone in the KeyCDN dashboard"
msgstr "Ustvarite vlečno cono na nadzorni plošči KeyCDN"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:19
msgid ""
"On the KeyCDN dashboard, start by navigating to the :menuselection:`Zones` "
"menu item on the left. On the form, give a value to the :guilabel:`Zone "
"Name`, which will appear as part of the :abbr:`CDN (Content Delivery "
"Network)`'s :abbr:`URL (Uniform Resource Locator)`. Then, set "
"the :guilabel:`Zone Status` to :guilabel:`active` to engage the zone. For "
"the :guilabel:`Zone Type` set the value to :guilabel:`Pull`, and then, "
"finally, under the :guilabel:`Pull Settings`, enter the :guilabel:`Origin "
"URL`— this address should be the full Odoo database :abbr:`URL (Uniform "
"Resource Locator)`."
msgstr ""
"Na nadzorni plošči KeyCDN začnite z navigacijo do menijske "
"postavke :menuselection:`Cone` na levi strani. V obrazcu vnesite vrednost "
"za :guilabel:`Ime cone`, ki se bo prikazalo kot del :abbr:`URL (enotnega "
"določevalnika virov)` :abbr:`CDN (omrežja za dostavo vsebin)`. Nato "
"nastavite :guilabel:`Status cone` na :guilabel:`aktiven`, da aktivirate "
"cono. Za :guilabel:`Tip cone` nastavite vrednost na :guilabel:`Vlek` in nato "
"končno pod :guilabel:`Nastavitvami vleka` vnesite :guilabel:`Izvorni URL` – "
"ta naslov mora biti poln :abbr:`URL (enotni določevalnik virov)` zbirke "
"podatkov Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:28
msgid ""
"Use ``https://yourdatabase.odoo.com`` and replace the *yourdatabase* "
"subdomain prefix with the actual name of the database. A custom :abbr:`URL "
"(Uniform Resource Locator)` can be used, as well, in place of the Odoo "
"subdomain that was provided to the database."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite ``https://vasabazapodatkov.odoo.com`` in zamenjajte predpono "
"poddomene *vasabazapodatkov* z dejanskim imenom baze podatkov. Namesto "
"poddomene Odoo, ki je bila dodeljena bazi podatkov, lahko uporabite tudi "
"prilagojen :abbr:`URL (enotni določevalnik virov)`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:None
msgid "KeyCDN's Zone configuration page."
msgstr "Stran za konfiguracijo cone KeyCDN."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:36
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`General Settings` heading below the zone form, click "
"the :guilabel:`Show all settings` button to expand the zone options. This "
"should be the last option on the page. After expanding "
"the :guilabel:`General Settings` ensure that the :guilabel:`CORS` option "
"is :guilabel:`enabled`."
msgstr ""
"Pod naslovom :guilabel:`Splošne nastavitve` pod obrazcem cone kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Prikaži vse nastavitve`, da razširite možnosti cone. To naj "
"bi bila zadnja možnost na strani. Po razširitvi :guilabel:`Splošnih "
"nastavitev` se prepričajte, da je "
"možnost :guilabel:`CORS` :guilabel:`omogočena`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:41
msgid ""
"Next, scroll to the bottom of the zone configuration page "
"and :guilabel:`Save` the changes. KeyCDN will indicate that the new zone "
"will be deployed. This can take about 10 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Nato se pomaknite na dno strani za konfiguracijo cone "
"in :guilabel:`shranite` spremembe. KeyCDN bo navedel, da bo nova cona "
"uvedena. To lahko traja približno 10 minut."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:None
msgid "KeyCDN deploying the new Zone."
msgstr "KeyCDN uvaja novo cono."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:49
msgid ""
"A new :guilabel:`Zone URL` has been generated for your Zone, in this example "
"it is ``pulltest-xxxxx.kxcdn.com``. This value will differ for each database."
msgstr ""
"Za vašo cono je bil ustvarjen nov :guilabel:`URL cone`, v tem primeru je to "
"``pulltest-xxxxx.kxcdn.com``. Ta vrednost se razlikuje za vsako bazo "
"podatkov."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:52
msgid ""
"Copy this :guilabel:`Zone URL` to a text editor for later, as it will be "
"used in the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte ta :guilabel:`URL cone` v urejevalnik besedila za poznejšo "
"uporabo, saj bo uporabljen v naslednjih korakih."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:55
msgid "Configure the Odoo instance with the new zone"
msgstr "Konfigurirajte instanco Odoo z novo cono"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:57
msgid ""
"In the Odoo :guilabel:`Website` app, go to the :menuselection:`Settings` and "
"then activate the :guilabel:`Content Delivery Network (CDN)` setting and "
"copy/paste the :guilabel:`Zone URL` value from the earlier step into "
"the :guilabel:`CDN Base URL` field. This field is only visible and "
"configurable when the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` is activated."
msgstr ""
"V aplikaciji Odoo :guilabel:`Spletna stran` pojdite "
"v :menuselection:`Nastavitve` in nato aktivirajte "
"nastavitev :guilabel:`Omrežje za dostavo vsebin (CDN)` ter kopirajte/"
"prilepite vrednost :guilabel:`URL cone` iz prejšnjega koraka v "
"polje :guilabel:`Osnovni URL CDN`. To polje je vidno in nastavljivo samo, ko "
"je aktiviran :ref:`razvijalski način <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:63
msgid ""
"Ensure that there are two *forward slashes* (`//`) before the :guilabel:`CDN "
"Base URL` and one forward slash (`/`) after the :guilabel:`CDN Base URL`."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da sta pred :guilabel:`Osnovni URL CDN` dve *poševnici* (`//"
"`) in ena poševnica (`/`) za :guilabel:`Osnovni URL CDN`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:66
msgid ":guilabel:`Save` the settings when complete."
msgstr "Ko končate, :guilabel:`shranite` nastavitve."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:None
msgid "Activate the CDN setting in Odoo."
msgstr "Aktivirajte nastavitev CDN v Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:72
msgid ""
"Now the website is using the CDN for the resources matching "
"the :guilabel:`CDN filters` regular expressions."
msgstr ""
"Zdaj spletna stran uporablja CDN za vire, ki ustrezajo regularnim "
"izrazom :guilabel:`Filtri CDN`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:75
msgid ""
"In the HTML of the Odoo website, the :abbr:`CDN (content delivery network)` "
"integration is evidenced as working properly by checking the :abbr:`URL "
"(Uniform Resource Locators)` of images. The *CDN Base URL* value can be seen "
"by using your web browser's :guilabel:`Inspect` feature on the Odoo website. "
"Look for it's record by searching within the :guilabel:`Network` tab inside "
"of devtools."
msgstr ""
"V HTML-ju spletne strani Odoo je pravilno delovanje integracije :abbr:`CDN "
"(omrežje za dostavo vsebin)` razvidno s preverjanjem :abbr:`URL (enotni "
"naslovi virov)` slik. Vrednost *Osnovni URL CDN* lahko vidite z uporabo "
"funkcije :guilabel:`Preveri` vašega spletnega brskalnika na spletni strani "
"Odoo. Poiščite njegov zapis s iskanjem v zavihku :guilabel:`Omrežje` znotraj "
"razvojnih orodij."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:None
msgid ""
"The CDN Base URL can be seen using the inspect function on the Odoo website."
msgstr ""
"Osnovni URL CDN lahko vidite z uporabo funkcije preveri na spletni strani "
"Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:85
msgid ""
"Prevent security issues by activating cross-origin resource sharing (CORS)"
msgstr ""
"Preprečite varnostne težave z aktiviranjem skupne rabe virov različnih "
"izvorov (CORS)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:87
msgid ""
"A security restriction in some browsers (such as Mozilla Firefox and Google "
"Chrome) prevents a remotely linked CSS file to fetch relative resources on "
"this same external server."
msgstr ""
"Varnostna omejitev v nekaterih brskalnikih (kot sta Mozilla Firefox in "
"Google Chrome) preprečuje oddaljeno povezani datoteki CSS, da bi pridobila "
"relativne vire na tem istem zunanjem strežniku."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:90
msgid ""
"If the :abbr:`CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing)` option isn't enabled in "
"the :guilabel:`CDN Zone`, the more obvious resulting problem on a standard "
"Odoo website will be the lack of *Font Awesome* icons because the font file "
"declared in the *Font Awesome* CSS won't be loaded from the remote server."
msgstr ""
"Če možnost :abbr:`CORS (skupna raba virov različnih izvorov)` ni omogočena "
"v :guilabel:`Coni CDN`, bo najbolj očitna posledična težava na standardni "
"spletni strani Odoo pomanjkanje ikon *Font Awesome*, ker datoteka pisave, "
"deklarirana v CSS *Font Awesome*, ne bo naložena z oddaljenega strežnika."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:95
msgid ""
"When these cross-origin resource issues occur, a security error message "
"similar to the output below will appear in the web browser's developer "
"console:"
msgstr ""
"Ko se pojavijo te težave z viri različnih izvorov, se v razvijalski konzoli "
"spletnega brskalnika prikaže varnostno sporočilo o napaki, podobno spodnjemu "
"izpisu:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:98
msgid ""
"``Font from origin 'http://pulltest-xxxxx.kxcdn.com' has been blocked from "
"loading /shop:1 by Cross-Origin Resource Sharing policy: No 'Access-Control-"
"Allow-Origin' header is present on the requested resource. Origin 'http://"
"yourdatabase.odoo.com' is therefore not allowed access.``"
msgstr ""
"``Font from origin 'http://pulltest-xxxxx.kxcdn.com' has been blocked from "
"loading /shop:1 by Cross-Origin Resource Sharing policy: No 'Access-Control-"
"Allow-Origin' header is present on the requested resource. Origin 'http://"
"yourdatabase.odoo.com' is therefore not allowed access.``"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:None
msgid "Error message populated in the browser console."
msgstr "Sporočilo o napaki, prikazano v konzoli brskalnika."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cdn.rst:106
msgid ""
"Enabling the :abbr:`CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing)` option in "
"the :abbr:`CDN (Content Delivery Network)` settings fixes this issue."
msgstr ""
"Omogočanje možnosti :abbr:`CORS (skupna raba virov različnih izvorov)` v "
"nastavitvah :abbr:`CDN (omrežje za dostavo vsebin)` odpravi to težavo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:3
msgid "Cookies bar"
msgstr "Vrstica za piškotke"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Cookies** are small text files sent to your device when you visit a "
"website. They are processed and stored by your browser and track user "
"information like login details, preferences, and browsing history. "
"**Essential cookies** are necessary for the website to function, while "
"**optional cookies** are used to analyze behavior or display ads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:10
msgid ""
"Data protection laws require notifying users about data collection methods "
"and purposes. **Cookies bar** fulfill this obligation by informing users on "
"their first visit and allowing them to decide whether to store all or only "
"essential cookies on their device."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:17
msgid ""
"To enable the cookies bar on your website, go to :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and enable :guilabel:`Cookies Bar` in "
"the :guilabel:`Privacy` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:21
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Cookies Policy <cookies-bar/policy>` page (/cookie-policy`) is "
"automatically created when you enable the cookies bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:29
msgid ""
"To adapt the display of the cookies bar, click :guilabel:`Edit`, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Invisible Elements` section at the bottom of the panel, and "
"click :guilabel:`Cookies Bar`. You can modify the :guilabel:`Layout` "
"and :guilabel:`Size` of the cookies bar, and enable :guilabel:`Backdrop` to "
"gray out the page in the background when the cookies bar is displayed on the "
"screen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:35
msgid ""
"Click anywhere in the building block to further customize the appearance of "
"the cookies bar using :guilabel:`Block`, :guilabel:`Column` and/"
"or :guilabel:`Inline Text` customization options."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite kjerkoli v gradniku, da nadalje prilagodite videz vrstice za "
"piškotke z uporabo možnosti za "
"prilagajanje :guilabel:`Blok`, :guilabel:`Stolpec` in/"
"ali :guilabel:`Besedilo v vrstici`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:38
msgid ""
"To edit the contents of the cookies bar (i.e., the consent message), click "
"directly in the building block."
msgstr ""
"Če želite urediti vsebino vrstice za piškotke (tj. sporočilo o soglasju), "
"kliknite neposredno v gradnik."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:44
msgid "Cookies policy"
msgstr "Pravilnik o piškotkih"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:46
msgid ""
"When you enable the cookies bar for your website, Odoo creates the **Cookie "
"Policy** page (`/cookie-policy`) containing a non-exhaustive list of "
"cookies, with their purpose and examples. To access it, click "
"the :guilabel:`Cookie Policy` hyperlink in the cookies bar or open the page "
"from :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Pages`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:51
msgid ""
"To adapt the content of the page according to your needs, click "
"the :guilabel:`Edit` button."
msgstr ""
"Če želite prilagoditi vsebino strani svojim potrebam, kliknite "
"gumb :guilabel:`Uredi`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:54
msgid ""
"You could add a link to this page in your website's footer, for example."
msgstr "To stran lahko na primer dodate v nogo spletnega mesta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/cookies_bar.rst:57
msgid ":doc:`Pages <../pages>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:3
msgid "Domain names"
msgstr "Imena domen"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:5
msgid ""
"Domain names are text-based addresses identifying online locations, such as "
"websites. They provide a more memorable and recognizable way for people to "
"navigate the internet than numerical IP addresses."
msgstr ""
"Imena domen so besedilni naslovi, ki identificirajo spletne lokacije, kot so "
"spletne strani. Zagotavljajo bolj spominljiv in prepoznaven način za "
"navigacijo po internetu kot številčni IP naslovi."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:8
msgid ""
"**Odoo Online** and **Odoo.sh** databases use a **subdomain** of the "
"`odoo.com` **domain** by default (e.g., `mycompany.odoo.com`)."
msgstr ""
"Podatkovne baze **Odoo Online** in **Odoo.sh** privzeto uporabljajo "
"**poddomena** domene `odoo.com` (npr. `mycompany.odoo.com`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:11
msgid ""
"However, you can use a custom domain name instead by :ref:`registering a "
"free domain name <domain-name/register>` (only available for Odoo Online "
"databases) or by :ref:`configuring a domain name you already own <domain-"
"name/existing>`."
msgstr ""
"Lahko pa namesto tega uporabite ime domene po meri tako, "
"da :ref:`registrirate brezplačno ime domene <domain-name/register>` (na "
"voljo samo za podatkovne baze Odoo Online) ali pa :ref:`konfigurirate ime "
"domene, ki ga že imate <domain-name/existing>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Register a free domain name [video] <https://www.odoo.com/"
"slides/slide/register-a-free-domain-name-1663>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: Register a free domain name [video] <https://www.odoo.com/"
"slides/slide/register-a-free-domain-name-1663>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:22
msgid "Register a free domain name with Odoo"
msgstr "Registracija brezplačnega imena domene z Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:24
msgid ""
"To register a one-year free domain name for your Odoo Online database, sign "
"in to your account and go to the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"databases>`_. Click the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) button next to "
"the database name and select :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`."
msgstr ""
"Za registracijo brezplačne domene za eno leto za vašo podatkovno zbirko Odoo "
"Online se prijavite v svoj račun in pojdite na `upravitelja podatkovne "
"zbirke <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_. Kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-gear` "
"(:guilabel:`zobnik`) poleg imena podatkovne zbirke in izberite :icon:`fa-"
"globe` :guilabel:`Imena domen`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:None
msgid "Accessing a database's domain names configuration"
msgstr "Dostop do konfiguracije imen domen podatkovne baze"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:32
msgid "Search for the desired domain name and check its availability."
msgstr "Poiščite želeno ime domene in preverite njeno razpoložljivost."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:None
msgid "Searching for an available domain name"
msgstr "Iskanje razpoložljivega imena domene"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:38
msgid ""
"Ensure the Website app is installed if the domain name registration option "
"does not appear."
msgstr ""
"Prepričajte se, da je aplikacija Website nameščena, če se možnost "
"registracije imena domene ne prikaže."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:40
msgid ""
"Select the desired domain name, fill in the :guilabel:`Domain Owner` form, "
"and click :guilabel:`Register`. The chosen domain name is directly linked to "
"the database."
msgstr ""
"Izberite želeno domensko ime, izpolnite obrazec :guilabel:`Lastnik domene` "
"in kliknite :guilabel:`Registriraj`. Izbrano domensko ime je neposredno "
"povezano z bazo podatkov."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:None
msgid "Filling in the domain owner information"
msgstr "Izpolnjevanje podatkov o lastniku domene"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:46
msgid ""
"Next, you should :ref:`map your domain name to your Odoo website <domain-"
"name/website-map>`."
msgstr ""
"Nato morate :ref:`povezati svoje domensko ime s spletnim mestom Odoo <domain-"
"name/website-map>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:49
msgid ""
"A verification email from `noreply@domainnameverification.net` will be sent "
"to the email address provided in the :guilabel:`Domain Owner` form. It is "
"essential to verify your email address to keep the domain active and receive "
"the renewal quote before expiration."
msgstr ""
"Potrditveno e-poštno sporočilo iz `noreply@domainnameverification.net` bo "
"poslano na e-poštni naslov, naveden v obrazcu :guilabel:`Lastnik domene`. "
"Nujno je, da potrdite svoj e-poštni naslov, da bo domena ostala aktivna in "
"da boste pred potekom prejeli ponudbo za podaljšanje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:53
msgid ""
"The domain name registration is free for the first year. After this period, "
"Odoo will continue to manage the domain in partnership with **Gandi.net**, "
"the domain name registrar, and you will be charged `Gandi.net's renewal rate "
"<https://www.gandi.net/en/domain>`_. Odoo sends a renewal quotation every "
"year to the email address mentioned in the :guilabel:`Domain Owner` form "
"several weeks before the expiration date of the domain. The domain is "
"renewed automatically when the quotation is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Registracija domenskega imena je prvo leto brezplačna. Po tem obdobju bo "
"Odoo še naprej upravljal domeno v partnerstvu z **Gandi.net**, registrarjem "
"domenskih imen, in zaračunal vam bo `obnovitvena cena Gandi.net <https://"
"www.gandi.net/en/domain>`_. Odoo vsako leto nekaj tednov pred datumom poteka "
"domene na e-poštni naslov, naveden v obrazcu :guilabel:`Lastnik domene`, "
"pošlje ponudbo za podaljšanje. Domena se obnovi samodejno, ko je ponudba "
"potrjena."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:61
msgid "The offer is only available for **Odoo Online** databases."
msgstr "Ponudba je na voljo samo za podatkovna baze **Odoo Online**."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:62
msgid "The offer is limited to **one** domain name per client."
msgstr "Ponudba je omejena na **eno** domensko ime na stranko."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:63
msgid "The offer is limited to the registration of a **new** domain name."
msgstr "Ponudba je omejena na registracijo **nove** domene."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:64
msgid ""
"The offer is available to *One App Free* plans. Ensure that your website "
"contains enough original content for Odoo to verify that your request is "
"legitimate and respects `Odoo's Acceptable Use Policy <https://www.odoo.com/"
"acceptable-use>`_. Given the high number of requests, it can take Odoo "
"several days to review them."
msgstr ""
"Ponudba je na voljo za naročnine *One App Free*. Prepričajte se, da vaše "
"spletno mesto vsebuje dovolj izvirne vsebine, da lahko Odoo preveri, ali je "
"vaša zahteva legitimna in ustreza `pravilom sprejemljive uporabe Odoo "
"<https://www.odoo.com/acceptable-use>`_. Zaradi velikega števila zahtev "
"lahko Odoo potrebuje več dni za njihov pregled."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:72
msgid "DNS records"
msgstr "DNS zapisi"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:74
msgid ""
"To manage your free domain name :abbr:`DNS (domain name system)` records, "
"open the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_, click "
"the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) button next to the database name, "
"select :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`, and click :guilabel:`DNS`."
msgstr ""
"Za upravljanje zapisov :abbr:`DNS (sistem imen domen)` vaše brezplačne "
"domene odprite `upravitelja podatkovne zbirke <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"databases>`_, kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`zobnik`) poleg imena "
"podatkovne zbirke, izberite :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Imena domen` in "
"kliknite :guilabel:`DNS`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`A`: the A record holds the IP address of the domain. It is "
"automatically created and **cannot** be edited or deleted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`A`: zapis A vsebuje IP naslov domene. Ustvari se samodejno in ga "
"**ni mogoče** urejati ali izbrisati."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`CNAME`: CNAME records forward one domain or subdomain to another "
"domain. One is automatically created to map the `www.` subdomain to the "
"database. If the database is renamed, the CNAME record **must** also be "
"renamed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`CNAME`: zapisi CNAME preusmerijo eno domeno ali poddomeno na "
"drugo domeno. Samodejno se ustvari zapis za preslikavo poddomene `www.` v "
"bazo podatkov. Če se baza podatkov preimenuje, je **treba** preimenovati "
"tudi zapis CNAME."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:83
msgid ":guilabel:`MX`: MX records instruct servers on where to deliver emails."
msgstr ":guilabel:`MX`: zapisi MX usmerijo strežnike, kam dostaviti e-pošto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TXT`: TXT records can be used for different purposes (e.g., to "
"verify domain name ownership)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`TXT`: zapise TXT je mogoče uporabiti za različne namene (npr. za "
"preverjanje lastništva domenskega imena)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:87
msgid ""
"Any modification to the DNS records can take up to **72 hours** to propagate "
"worldwide on all servers."
msgstr ""
"Vsaka sprememba DNS zapisov lahko traja do **72 ur**, da se razširi po svetu "
"na vse strežnike."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:91
msgid ""
"`Contact Odoo support <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ if you need assistance "
"to manage your domain name."
msgstr ""
"`Kontaktirajte podporo Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_, če potrebujete "
"pomoč pri upravljanju vaše domene."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:95
msgid "Mailbox"
msgstr "Poštni predal"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:97
msgid ""
"The one-year free domain name offer does **not** include a mailbox. There "
"are two options to link your domain name with a mailbox."
msgstr ""
"Ponudba brezplačnega domenskega imena za eno leto **ne** vključuje "
"nabiralnika. Za povezavo domenskega imena z nabiralnikom obstajata dve "
"možnosti."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:101
msgid "Use a subdomain"
msgstr "Uporabite poddomena"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:103
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated subdomain (for example, ``mail.mydomain.com``) "
"to :ref:`route incoming emails directly to your Odoo database via DNS "
"records <dns_record_setup>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:109
msgid "Use an external email provider"
msgstr "Uporabite zunanjega ponudnika e-pošte"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:111
msgid ""
"To use an external email provider, you should configure an MX record. To do "
"so, open the `database manager <https://www.odoo.com/my/databases>`_, click "
"the :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`gear`) button next to the database name and "
"select :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Domain Names`. Click :guilabel:`DNS`, "
"then :guilabel:`Add DNS record` and select :guilabel:`MX`. The values you "
"should enter for the :guilabel:`Name`, :guilabel:`Content`, "
"and :guilabel:`Priority` fields depend on the external email provider."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo zunanjega ponudnika e-pošte morate nastaviti MX zapis. Če želite "
"to storiti, odprite `upravitelja podatkovne zbirke <https://www.odoo.com/my/"
"databases>`_, kliknite gumb :icon:`fa-gear` (:guilabel:`zobnik`) poleg imena "
"podatkovne zbirke in izberite :icon:`fa-globe` :guilabel:`Imena domen`. "
"Kliknite :guilabel:`DNS`, nato :guilabel:`Dodaj DNS zapis` in "
"izberite :guilabel:`MX`. Vrednosti, ki jih morate vnesti za "
"polja :guilabel:`Ime`, :guilabel:`Vsebina` in :guilabel:`Prednost`, so "
"odvisne od zunanjega ponudnika e-pošte."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:119
msgid ""
"`Google Workspace: MX record values <https://support.google.com/a/answer/"
"174125?hl=en>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Google Workspace: vrednosti zapisa MX <https://support.google.com/a/answer/"
"174125?hl=en>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:120
msgid ""
"`Outlook and Exchange Online: Add an MX record for email <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/admin/get-help-with-domains/create-"
"dns-records-at-any-dns-hosting-provider?view=o365-worldwide#add-an-mx-record-"
"for-email-outlook-exchange-online>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Outlook in Exchange Online: Dodajte zapis MX za e-pošto <https://"
"learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/admin/get-help-with-domains/create-"
"dns-records-at-any-dns-hosting-provider?view=o365-worldwide#add-an-mx-record-"
"for-email-outlook-exchange-online>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:123
msgid "Google Workspace"
msgstr "Google Workspace"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:125
msgid ""
"To use your free domain name on Gmail, register to `Google Workspace "
"<https://workspace.google.com>`_."
msgstr ""
"Za uporabo vaše brezplačne domene v Gmailu se registrirajte na `Google "
"Workspace <https://workspace.google.com>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:128
msgid ""
"During the registration process, select :guilabel:`Set up using your "
"existing domain` when asked to :guilabel:`Choose a way to set up your "
"account`, and enter your domain (e.g., `yourdomain.com`) when "
"asked :guilabel:`What's your business's domain name?`."
msgstr ""
"Med postopkom registracije izberite :guilabel:`Nastavite z obstoječo "
"domeno`, ko vas pozove k :guilabel:`Izberite način nastavitve računa`, in "
"vnesite svojo domeno (npr. `vasadomena.com`), ko vas "
"vpraša :guilabel:`Katero domeno ima vaše podjetje?`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:133
msgid "Domain ownership verification"
msgstr "Preverjanje lastništva domene"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:135
msgid ""
"Sign in to Google Workspace. When asked to verify you own your domain, "
"click :guilabel:`Switch to manual verification`."
msgstr ""
"Prijavite se v Google Workspace. Ko boste pozvani, da preverite lastništvo "
"domene, kliknite :guilabel:`Preklopi na ročno preverjanje`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:0
