"(npr. `www.vasadomena.com`), kliknite :guilabel:`Preveri` "
"in :guilabel:`Potrjujem, je narejeno`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:0
msgid "Mapping a domain name to an Odoo Online database"
msgstr "Preslikava domenskega imena na podatkovno bazo Odoo Online"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:345
msgid ""
"On Odoo.sh, go to :menuselection:`Branches --> select your branch --> "
"Settings --> Custom domains`, type the domain name to add, then "
"click :guilabel:`Add domain`."
msgstr ""
"Na Odoo.sh pojdite na :menuselection:`Veje --> izberite svojo vejo --> "
"Nastavitve --> Domene po meri`, vnesite domensko ime, ki ga želite dodati, "
"nato kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj domeno`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:0
msgid "Mapping a domain name to an Odoo.sh branch"
msgstr "Preslikava domenskega imena na vejo Odoo.sh"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:352
msgid ":ref:`Odoo.sh branches: settings tab <odoo-sh/branches/tabs/settings>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Zavihek nastavitev vej Odoo.sh <odoo-sh/branches/tabs/settings>`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:357
msgid "SSL encryption (HTTPS protocol)"
msgstr "Šifriranje SSL (protokol HTTPS)"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:359
msgid ""
"**SSL encryption** allows visitors to navigate a website through a secure "
"connection, which appears as the *https://* protocol at the beginning of a "
"web address rather than the non-secure *http://* protocol."
msgstr ""
"**Šifriranje SSL** obiskovalcem omogoča brskanje po spletnem mestu prek "
"varne povezave, ki se prikaže kot protokol *https://* na začetku spletnega "
"naslova namesto nezaščitenega protokola *http://*."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:363
msgid ""
"Odoo generates a separate SSL certificate for each domain :ref:`mapped to a "
"database <domain-name/db-map>` using `Let's Encrypt's certificate authority "
"and ACME protocol <https://letsencrypt.org/how-it-works/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ustvari ločen certifikat SSL za vsako domeno, :ref:`preslikano v bazo "
"podatkov <domain-name/db-map>`, z uporabo `overitelja certifikatov Let's "
"Encrypt in protokola ACME <https://letsencrypt.org/how-it-works/>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:368
msgid "Certificate generation may take up to 24 hours."
msgstr "Generiranje certifikata lahko traja do 24 ur."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:369
msgid ""
"Several attempts to validate your certificate are made for five days after "
"you map your domain name to your database."
msgstr ""
"Po tem, ko preslikate svoje domensko ime v svojo bazo podatkov, se pet dni "
"izvaja več poskusov validacije vašega certifikata."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:371
msgid "If you use another service, you can keep using it or change to Odoo's."
msgstr ""
"Če uporabljate drugo storitev, jo lahko še naprej uporabljate ali preklopite "
"na Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:374
msgid ""
"No SSL certificate is generated for naked domains :dfn:`(domain names "
"without any subdomains or prefixes)`."
msgstr ""
"Za gole domene :dfn:`(domenska imena brez poddomen ali predpon)` se ne "
"generira certifikat SSL."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:380
msgid "Web base URL of a database"
msgstr "Spletni osnovni URL podatkovne baze"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:383
msgid ""
"If the Website app is installed on your database, skip this section and "
"continue from the :ref:`Map a domain name to a website <domain-name/website-"
"map>` section."
msgstr ""
"Če imate v svoji bazi podatkov nameščeno aplikacijo Spletna stran, "
"preskočite ta razdelek in nadaljujte z razdelkom :ref:`Preslika domenskega "
"imena na spletno stran <domain-name/website-map>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:386
msgid ""
"The *web base URL* or root URL of a database affects your main website "
"address and all the links sent to your customers (e.g., quotations, portal "
"links, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"*Spletni osnovni URL* ali korenski URL podatkovne baze vpliva na vaš glavni "
"naslov spletnega mesta in vse povezave, poslane vašim strankam (npr. "
"ponudbe, povezave do portala itd.)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:389
msgid ""
"To make your custom domain name the *web base URL* of your database, access "
"your database using your custom domain name and log in as an "
"administrator :dfn:`(a user part of the Settings access right group under "
"Administration)`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite svoje domensko ime po meri nastaviti kot *spletni osnovni URL* "
"svoje podatkovne baze, dostopite do svoje podatkovne baze z uporabo svojega "
"domenskega imena po meri in se prijavite kot skrbnik :dfn:`(uporabnik, ki je "
"del skupine dostopnih pravic Nastavitve pod Administracija)`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:394
msgid ""
"If you access your database with the original Odoo address (e.g., "
"`mycompany.odoo.com`), the *web base URL* of your database will be updated "
"accordingly. To prevent the automatic update of the *web base URL* when an "
"administrator logs in to the database, activate the :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>`, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System "
"Parameters --> New`, and enter `web.base.url.freeze` as the :guilabel:`Key` "
"and `True` as the :guilabel:`Value`."
msgstr ""
"Če dostopate do svoje baze podatkov z izvirnim naslovom Odoo (npr. "
"`mycompany.odoo.com`), bo *spletni osnovni URL* vaše baze podatkov ustrezno "
"posodobljen. Če želite preprečiti samodejno posodabljanje *spletnega "
"osnovnega URL-ja*, ko se skrbnik prijavi v bazo podatkov, "
"aktivirajte :ref:`način razvijalca <developer-mode>`, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Nastavitve --> Tehnično --> Sistemski parametri --> Novo` "
"in vnesite `web.base.url.freeze` kot :guilabel:`Ključ` ter `True` "
"kot :guilabel:`Vrednost`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:401
msgid ""
"You can also set the web base URL manually. To do so, activate "
"the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, go to :menuselection:`Settings --"
"> Technical --> System Parameters`, and search for the `web.base.url` key "
"(create it if necessary) and enter the full address of your website as the "
"value (e.g., `https://www.yourdomain.com`). The URL must include the "
"protocol `https://` (or `http://`) and *not* end with a slash (`/`)."
msgstr ""
"Spletni osnovni URL lahko nastavite tudi ročno. Če želite to storiti, "
"aktivirajte :ref:`način razvijalca <developer-mode>`, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Nastavitve --> Tehnično --> Sistemski parametri`, "
"poiščite ključ `web.base.url` (ustvarite ga, če je potrebno) in kot vrednost "
"vnesite polni naslov vaše spletne strani (npr. `https://"
"www.vasadomena.com`). URL mora vključevati protokol `https://` (ali `http://"
"`) in se *ne sme* končati s poševnico (`/`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:410
msgid "Map a domain name to an Odoo website"
msgstr "Preslikava domenskega imena na spletno mesto Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:412
msgid ""
"Mapping your domain name to your website is different than mapping it to "
"your database:"
msgstr ""
"Preslikava vašega domenskega imena na vaše spletno mesto se razlikuje od "
"preslikave na vašo podatkovno bazo:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:414
msgid ""
"It defines your domain name as the main one for your website, helping search "
"engines to index your website correctly."
msgstr ""
"Določa vaše domensko ime kot glavno za vašo spletno stran, kar pomaga "
"iskalnikom pri pravilnem indeksiranju vaše spletne strani."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:416
msgid ""
"It defines your domain name as the base URL for your database, including "
"portal links sent by email to your customers."
msgstr ""
"Določa vaše domensko ime kot osnovni URL za vašo bazo podatkov, vključno s "
"povezavami do portala, poslanimi po e-pošti vašim strankam."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:418
msgid ""
"If you have multiple websites, it maps your domain name to the appropriate "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Če imate več spletnih mest, preslika vaše domensko ime na ustrezno spletno "
"mesto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:420
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`. If you have "
"multiple websites, select the one you want to configure. In "
"the :guilabel:`Domain` field, enter the address of your website (e.g., "
"`https://www.yourdomain.com`) and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Pojdite na :menuselection:`Spletna stran --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. "
"Če imate več spletnih strani, izberite tisto, ki jo želite konfigurirati. V "
"polje :guilabel:`Domena` vnesite naslov vaše spletne strani (npr. `https://"
"www.vasadomena.com`) in kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:425
msgid ""
"Mapping your domain name to your Odoo website prevents Google Search from "
"indexing your original database address (e.g., `mycompany.odoo.com`)."
msgstr ""
"Preslikava vašega domenskega imena na vašo spletno mesto Odoo prepreči, da "
"bi Google Search indeksiral vaš prvotni naslov zbirke podatkov (npr. "
"`mycompany.odoo.com`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:428
msgid ""
"If both addresses are already indexed, it may take some time before the "
"indexation of the second address is removed from Google Search. You can use "
"the `Google Search Console <https://search.google.com/search-console/"
"welcome>`_ to fix the issue."
msgstr ""
"Če sta oba naslova že indeksirana, lahko traja nekaj časa, preden se "
"indeksacija drugega naslova odstrani iz Google Search. Za odpravo težave "
"lahko uporabite `Google Search Console <https://search.google.com/search-"
"console/welcome>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names.rst:433
msgid ""
"If you have multiple websites and companies on your database, make sure to "
"select the right :guilabel:`Company` under :menuselection:`Website --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`. Doing so indicates Odoo which URL to use as "
"the :ref:`base URL <domain-name/web-base-url>` according to the company in "
"use."
msgstr ""
"Če imate v svoji bazi podatkov več spletnih strani in podjetij, se "
"prepričajte, da pod :menuselection:`Spletna stran --> Konfiguracija --> "
"Nastavitve` izberete pravo :guilabel:`Podjetje`. S tem naznačite Odooju, "
"kateri URL naj uporabi kot :ref:`osnovni URL <domain-name/web-base-url>` "
"glede na uporabljeno podjetje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:3
msgid "Google Search Console"
msgstr "Googlova konzola za iskanje"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:5
msgid ""
"Google Search Console is a free web service provided by Google that allows "
"website owners to monitor, maintain, and troubleshoot their site's presence "
"in Google Search results. It offers valuable insights into how Google views "
"and interacts with your site, helping you optimize its performance."
msgstr ""
"Google Search Console je brezplačna spletna storitev, ki jo zagotavlja "
"Google in omogoča lastnikom spletnih mest nadzor, vzdrževanje in "
"odpravljanje težav pri prisotnosti njihovega spletnega mesta v rezultatih "
"iskanja Google. Ponuja dragocene vpoglede v to, kako Google gleda na vaše "
"spletno mesto in komunicira z njim, kar vam pomaga optimizirati njegovo "
"delovanje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:10
msgid ""
"To enable Google Search Console for your website, go to `Google Search "
"Console <https://search.google.com/search-console/welcome>`_. Then, select "
"the property type :ref:`GSC-Domain` or :ref:`GSC-URL prefix`."
msgstr ""
"Če želite omogočiti Google Search Console za vaše spletno mesto, pojdite na "
"`Google Search Console <https://search.google.com/search-console/welcome>`_. "
"Nato izberite vrsto lastnosti :ref:`GSC-Domain` ali :ref:`GSC-URL prefix`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:None
msgid "Google Search Console domain or URL prefix"
msgstr "Domena ali predpona URL-ja Google Search Console"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:20
msgid "Domain property"
msgstr "Lastnost domene"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:22
msgid ""
"A domain property in Search Console tracks all versions of your website, "
"including subdomains and protocols (http/https). This comprehensive view "
"allows you to analyze your overall website's search performance and make "
"informed decisions to optimize its visibility. Enter the domain, e.g., "
"`example.com` and click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""
"Lastnost domene v Search Console sledi vsem različicam vašega spletnega "
"mesta, vključno s poddomenami in protokoli (http/https). Ta celovit pogled "
"vam omogoča analizo splošnega učinka vašega spletnega mesta v iskanju in "
"sprežemanje informiranih odločitev za optimizacijo njegove vidnosti. Vnesite "
"domeno, npr. `example.com`, in kliknite :guilabel:`Nadaljuj`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:28
msgid ""
"The domain property type can only be verified via `DNS record <https://"
"support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_."
msgstr ""
"Vrsto lastnosti domene je mogoče preveriti samo prek `DNS zapisa <https://"
"support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:30
msgid ""
"Google suggests creating at least one domain property to represent your "
"site, as it is the most complete view of your website information."
msgstr ""
"Google priporoča ustvarjanje vsaj ene lastnosti domene za predstavitev "
"vašega spletnega mesta, saj je to najbolj celovit pogled na informacije o "
"vašem spletnem mestu."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:36
msgid "URL prefix property"
msgstr "Lastnost predpone URL-ja"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:38
msgid ""
"This type of verification is usually simpler as you have multiple "
"verification methods, such as using your existing Google Analytics or Tag "
"Manager account. It also makes sense to view a section of your website "
"separately. For example, if you work with a consultant on a specific part of "
"your website, you might want to verify this part separately to limit access "
"to your data. Enter the URL, e.g., `https://www.example.odoo.com` and "
"click :guilabel:`Continue`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:46
msgid "Site ownership verification"
msgstr "Preverjanje lastništva spletnega mesta"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:48
msgid ""
"Before using Google Search Console for your website, you must verify your "
"site ownership. This verification process is a security measure that "
"protects both you and Google. It ensures that only authorized users have "
"access to sensitive data and that you have control over how your website is "
"treated in Google Search."
msgstr ""
"Preden uporabite Google Search Console za vaše spletno mesto, morate "
"preveriti lastništvo spletnega mesta. Ta postopek preverjanja je varnostni "
"ukrep, ki ščiti tako vas kot Google. Zagotavlja, da imajo dostop do "
"občutljivih podatkov samo pooblaščeni uporabniki in da imate nadzor nad tem, "
"kako se z vašim spletnim mestom ravna v iskanju Google."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:53
msgid "Five methods are available to do this:"
msgstr "Na voljo je pet načinov za to:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:57
msgid ":ref:`GSC-HTML-file-upload`"
msgstr ":ref:`GSC-HTML-file-upload`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:58
msgid ""
"`DNS record <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"
msgstr ""
"`DNS zapis <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#domain_name_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:59
msgid ""
"`HTML tag <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#meta_tag_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"
msgstr ""
"`HTML oznaka <https://support.google.com/webmasters/answer/9008080?"
"hl=en#meta_tag_verification&zippy=%2Chtml-tag>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:60
msgid ""
"`Google Analytics tracking code <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_analytics_verification>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Koda za sledenje Google Analytics <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_analytics_verification>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:61
msgid ""
"`Google Tag Manager container snippet <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_tag_manager_verification>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Delček vsebnika Google Tag Manager <https://support.google.com/webmasters/"
"answer/9008080?hl=en#google_tag_manager_verification>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:64
msgid ""
"The best method for you depends on your comfort level and technical "
"expertise. For beginners, using a file upload or HTML tag might be easiest. "
"Those options are convenient if you already use Google Analytics or Tag "
"Manager. You need to access your domain registrar's settings for domain "
"verification."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:72
msgid "HTML file upload"
msgstr "Nalaganje datoteke HTML"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:74
msgid ""
"This method involves uploading an HTML file provided by Google containing "
"the verification code you have to put in your Odoo's Website Settings. "
"Google verifies ownership by checking for this code."
msgstr ""
"Ta metoda vključuje nalaganje datoteke HTML, ki jo zagotovi Google in "
"vsebuje verifikacijsko kodo, ki jo morate vnesti v nastavitve spletnega "
"mesta Odoo. Google preveri lastništvo s preverjanjem te kode."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:77
msgid ""
"Once you added your website URL under the URL prefix option and "
"clicked :guilabel:`continue`, expand the HTML file section where you find a "
"download :icon:`fa-download` button."
msgstr ""
"Ko dodate URL svojega spletnega mesta pod možnost predpone URL in "
"kliknete :guilabel:`nadaljuj`, razširite razdelek datoteke HTML, kjer "
"najdete gumb za prenos :icon:`fa-download`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:0
msgid "HTML file download"
msgstr "Prenos datoteke HTML"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:83
msgid ""
"Download your HTML verification file and copy the verification code (e.g., "
"`google123abc.html`)."
msgstr ""
"Prenesite svojo verifikacijsko datoteko HTML in kopirajte verifikacijsko "
"kodo (npr. `google123abc.html`)."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:0
msgid "Open and copy html file"
msgstr "Odprite in kopirajte datoteko html"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:88
msgid ""
"In your Odoo database, go to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, and enable :guilabel:`Google Search Console` in "
"the :guilabel:`SEO` section. Paste the verification code (e.g., "
"`google123abc.html`) in the dedicated field."
msgstr ""
"V svoji zbirki podatkov Odoo pojdite na :menuselection:`Spletno mesto --> "
"Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve` in omogočite :guilabel:`Google Search Console` "
"v razdelku :guilabel:`SEO`. Prilepite verifikacijsko kodo (npr. "
"`google123abc.html`) v namensko polje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:0
msgid "Paste html code in Odoo"
msgstr "Prilepite kodo html v Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:95
msgid ""
"In Google Search Console, click :guilabel:`Verify`. If you perform the steps "
"above correctly, verification should be done immediately."
msgstr ""
"V Google Search Console kliknite :guilabel:`Preveri`. Če pravilno izvedete "
"zgornje korake, bi morala biti verifikacija opravljena takoj."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/google_search_console.rst:99
msgid ":doc:`domain_names`"
msgstr ":doc:`domain_names`"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:3
msgid "Multiple websites"
msgstr "Več spletnih mest"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo allows you to create multiple websites from the same database. This can "
"be useful, for example, if you have multiple brands operating under your "
"organization, or to create separate websites for different products/"
"services, or different audiences. In these cases, having different websites "
"can help avoid confusion and make it easier to tailor your digital outreach "
"strategies and reach your target audience."
msgstr ""
"Odoo vam omogoča ustvarjanje več spletnih strani iz iste baze podatkov. To "
"je lahko koristno na primer, če imate v svoji organizaciji več blagovnih "
"znamk, ali za ustvarjanje ločenih spletnih strani za različne izdelke/"
"storitve ali različne ciljne skupine. V teh primerih lahko različne spletne "
"strani pomagajo preprečiti zmedo in olajšajo prilagajanje vaših strategij "
"digitalnega dosega ter doseganje ciljne publike."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:11
msgid ""
"Each website can be designed and configured independently with its "
"own :doc:`domain name <domain_names>`, :doc:`theme <../web_design/"
"themes>`, :doc:`pages <../pages>`, :doc:`menus <../pages/"
"menus>`, :doc:`languages <translate>`, :doc:`products <../../ecommerce/"
"products>`, assigned sales team, etc. They can also :ref:`share content and "
"pages <multi-website/website_content>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:18
msgid ""
"Duplicate content (i.e., pages and content shared between multiple websites) "
"can have a negative impact on :doc:`../pages/seo`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:22
msgid "Website creation"
msgstr "Ustvarjanje spletne strani"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:24
msgid "To create a new website, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "Če želite ustvariti novo spletno stran, sledite naslednjim korakom:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:27
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ New Website`."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`+ Nova spletna stran`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:0
msgid "New website button"
msgstr "Gumb za novo spletno stran"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:32
msgid ""
"Specify the :guilabel:`Website Name` and :guilabel:`Website domain`. Each "
"website must be published under its own :doc:`domain <domain_names>`."
msgstr ""
"Določite :guilabel:`Ime spletne strani` in :guilabel:`Domeno spletne "
"strani`. Vsaka spletna stran mora biti objavljena pod svojo "
"lastno :doc:`domeno <domain_names>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:34
msgid ""
"Adapt the :guilabel:`Company name`, :guilabel:`Languages` "
"and :guilabel:`Default language` if needed."
msgstr ""
"Po potrebi prilagodite :guilabel:`Ime podjetja`, :guilabel:`Jezike` "
"in :guilabel:`Privzeti jezik`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:36
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Create` button."
msgstr "Kliknite gumb :guilabel:`Ustvari`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:38
msgid "You can then start building your new website."
msgstr "Nato lahko začnete graditi svojo novo spletno stran."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:41
msgid ""
"By default, all website-related apps that you have installed (e.g. "
"**eCommerce**, **Forum**, **Blog**, etc.) and their related website pages "
"are also available on the new website. You can remove them by amending the "
"website's menu."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto so vse aplikacije, povezane s spletno stranjo, ki ste jih namestili "
"(npr. **eCommerce**, **Forum**, **Blog** itd.), in njihove povezane spletne "
"strani na voljo tudi na novi spletni strani. Odstranite jih lahko s "
"spreminjanjem menija spletne strani."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:46
msgid "Switching websites"
msgstr "Preklop med spletnimi stranmi"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:48
msgid ""
"To switch from one website to another, click the menu next to "
"the :guilabel:`+New` button in the top right corner and select the website "
"you want to switch to."
msgstr ""
"Če želite preklopiti iz ene spletne strani na drugo, kliknite meni poleg "
"gumba :guilabel:`+Novo` v zgornjem desnem kotu in izberite spletno stran, na "
"katero želite preklopiti."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:None
msgid "Website selector"
msgstr "Izbirnik spletnega mesta"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:55
msgid ""
"When you switch websites, you are redirected to the homepage of the other "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Ko preklopite med spletnimi mesti, ste preusmerjeni na domačo stran drugega "
"spletnega mesta."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:58
msgid "Website-specific configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija za določeno spletno mesto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:60
msgid ""
"Most website settings are website-specific, which means they can be enabled/"
"disabled per website. To adapt the settings for a website, go "
"to :menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Settings`. Select the "
"desired website in the field :guilabel:`Settings of Website` at the top of "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` page, in the **yellow** banner. Then, adapt the "
"options for that specific website."
msgstr ""
"Večina nastavitev spletnega mesta velja le za določeno spletno mesto, kar "
"pomeni, da jih lahko omogočite/onemogočite za vsako spletno mesto posebej. "
"Če želite prilagoditi nastavitve za spletno mesto, pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Spletno mesto --> Konfiguracija --> Nastavitve`. Izberite "
"želeno spletno mesto v polju :guilabel:`Nastavitve spletnega mesta` na vrhu "
"strani :guilabel:`Nastavitve` v **rumenem** pasicu. Nato prilagodite "
"možnosti za to določeno spletno mesto."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:67
msgid ""
"Websites are created with the default settings; the settings are not copied "
"from one website to the other."
msgstr ""
"Spletna mesta so ustvarjena s privzetimi nastavitvami; nastavitve se ne "
"kopirajo iz enega spletnega mesta na drugo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:69
msgid ""
"In a :doc:`multi-company environment </applications/general/companies>`, "
"each website can be linked to a specific company in your database so that "
"only company-related data (e.g., products, jobs, events, etc.) is displayed "
"on the website. To display company-specific data, set the desired company in "
"the :guilabel:`Company` field."
msgstr ""
"V :doc:`večpodjetniških okoljih </applications/general/companies>` je lahko "
"vsako spletno mesto povezano z določenim podjetjem v vaši zbirki podatkov, "
"tako da so na spletnem mestu prikazani le podatki, povezani s podjetjem "
"(npr. izdelki, delovna mesta, dogodki itd.). Če želite prikazati podatke, "
"specifične za podjetje, nastavite želeno podjetje v "
"polju :guilabel:`Podjetje`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:77
msgid "Content availability"
msgstr "Razpoložljivost vsebine"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:79
msgid ""
"By default, pages, products, events, etc. created from the frontend (using "
"the :guilabel:`+New` button) are only available on the website from which it "
"was created. Records created from the backend, however, are made available "
"on all websites by default. The content's availability can be changed in the "
"backend, in the :guilabel:`Website` field. For example, for products, go "
"to :menuselection:`eCommerce --> Products`, then select the product and go "
"to the :guilabel:`Sales` tab. For forums, go "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Forums`, then select the forum."
msgstr ""
"Privzeto so strani, izdelki, dogodki itd., ustvarjeni iz uporabniškega "
"vmesnika (z gumbom :guilabel:`+Novo`), na voljo samo na spletnem mestu, s "
"katerega so bili ustvarjeni. Zapisi, ustvarjeni iz zalednega sistema, pa so "
"privzeto na voljo na vseh spletnih mestih. Razpoložljivost vsebine lahko "
"spremenite v zalednem sistemu v polju :guilabel:`Spletno mesto`. Na primer, "
"za izdelke pojdite na :menuselection:`Spletna trgovina --> Izdelki`, nato "
"izberite izdelek in pojdite na zavihek :guilabel:`Prodaja`. Za forume "
"pojdite na :menuselection:`Konfiguracija --> Forumi`, nato izberite forum."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:None
msgid "Website field in Forum form"
msgstr "Polje Spletno mesto v obrazcu Foruma"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:92
msgid "Records and features can be made available:"
msgstr "Zapise in funkcije lahko omogočite:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:94
msgid "On all websites: leave the :guilabel:`Website` field empty;"
msgstr ""
"Na vseh spletnih mestih: pustite polje :guilabel:`Spletno mesto` prazno;"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:95
msgid "Only on one website: set the :guilabel:`Website` field accordingly;"
msgstr ""
"Samo na enem spletnem mestu: ustrezno nastavite polje :guilabel:`Spletno "
"mesto`;"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:96
msgid ""
"On some websites: in this case, you should duplicate the item and set "
"the :guilabel:`Website` field."
msgstr ""
"Na nekaterih spletnih mestih: v tem primeru podvojite element in nastavite "
"polje :guilabel:`Spletno mesto`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:100
msgid "Website pages"
msgstr "Strani spletnega mesta"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:102
msgid ""
"To modify the website on which a page is to be published, proceed as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite spremeniti spletno mesto, na katerem bo stran objavljena, "
"postopajte na naslednji način:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:104
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Website --> Site --> Pages`."
msgstr "Pojdite na :menuselection:`Spletno mesto --> Stran --> Strani`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:105
msgid ""
"Open the search panel and select the website on which the page is currently "
"published."
msgstr ""
"Odprite iskalno ploščo in izberite spletno mesto, na katerem je stran "
"trenutno objavljena."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:0
msgid "Display pages per website"
msgstr "Prikaz strani po spletnem mestu"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:110
msgid "Tick the check box next to the page(s) you want to change."
msgstr "Označite potrditveno polje poleg strani, ki jih želite spremeniti."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:111
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Website` field and select the website, or empty it to "
"publish the page on all websites."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite polje :guilabel:`Spletno mesto` in izberite spletno mesto ali ga "
"izpraznite, da objavite stran na vseh spletnih mestih."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:115
msgid ""
"Each website must have its own homepage; you may not use the same homepage "
"for several websites."
msgstr ""
"Vsako spletno mesto mora imeti svojo domačo stran; iste domače strani ne "
"smete uporabljati za več spletnih mest."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:118
msgid "eCommerce features"
msgstr "Funkcije e-trgovine"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:120
msgid ""
"eCommerce features such as products, eCommerce categories, pricelists, "
"discounts, payment providers, etc. can be restricted to :ref:`a specific "
"website <website_field>`."
msgstr ""
"Funkcije spletne trgovine, kot so izdelki, kategorije spletne trgovine, "
"ceniki, popusti, ponudniki plačil itd., so lahko omejene na :ref:`določeno "
"spletno mesto <website_field>`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:126
msgid ""
"You can :doc:`allow your customers to use the same account <../../ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts>` on all of your websites by enabling "
"the :guilabel:`Shared Customer Accounts` check box in the website settings."
msgstr ""
"Svojim strankam lahko :doc:`omogočite uporabo istega računa <../../ecommerce/"
"customer_accounts>` na vseh vaših spletnih mestih, tako da v nastavitvah "
"spletnega mesta omogočite potrditveno polje :guilabel:`Skupni računi strank`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:131
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Določanje cen"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:133
msgid ""
"Products can be priced differently based on the website "
"using :ref:`pricelists <ecommerce/pricelists>`. The following configuration "
"is required:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:137
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the :guilabel:`Shop - Products` section and select "
"the :guilabel:`Pricelists` option :guilabel:`Multiple prices per product`."
msgstr ""
"Pomaknite se navzdol do razdelka :guilabel:`Trgovina - Izdelki` in izberite "
"možnost :guilabel:`Ceniki` :guilabel:`Več cen na izdelek`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:139
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Pricelists` to define new pricelists or edit existing ones."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :guilabel:`Ceniki`, da določite nove cenike ali uredite obstoječe."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:140
msgid ""
"Select the pricelist or click :guilabel:`New` to create a new one, then "
"select the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab and set the :guilabel:`Website` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Izberite cenik ali kliknite :guilabel:`Novo`, da ustvarite novega, nato "
"izberite zavihek :guilabel:`Konfiguracija` in nastavite "
"polje :guilabel:`Spletno mesto`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:149
msgid ""
"Each website has its own :ref:`analytics <analytics/plausible>`. To switch "
"between websites, click the buttons in the upper right corner."
msgstr ""
"Vsako spletno mesto ima svoje :ref:`analitike <analytics/plausible>`. Če "
"želite preklopiti med spletnimi mesti, kliknite gumbe v zgornjem desnem kotu."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:None
msgid "Switch websites in analytics"
msgstr "Preklapljanje med spletnimi mesti v analitikah"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:156
msgid "Other reporting data"
msgstr "Drugi podatki o poročanju"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/multi_website.rst:158
msgid ""
"Other reporting data such as eCommerce dashboard data, online sales analyses "
"and visitors can be grouped by website if necessary. Open the search panel "
"and select :guilabel:`Group by --> Website`."
msgstr ""
"Druge podatke o poročanju, kot so podatki nadzorne plošče spletne trgovine, "
"analize spletne prodaje in obiskovalci, lahko po potrebi združite po "
"spletnem mestu. Odprite iskalno ploščo in izberite :guilabel:`Združi po --> "
"Spletno mesto`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:3
msgid "Forms spam protection"
msgstr "Zaščita obrazcev pred neželeno pošto"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:5
msgid ""
":ref:`Cloudflare Turnstile <website/spam_protection/cloudflare-turnstile>` "
"and :ref:`Google reCAPTCHA v3 <website/spam_protection/google-recaptcha>` "
"protect website forms against spam and abuse. They attempt to distinguish "
"between human and bot submissions using non-interactive challenges based on "
"telemetry and visitor behavior."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Cloudflare Turnstile <website/spam_protection/cloudflare-turnstile>` "
"in :ref:`Google reCAPTCHA v3 <website/spam_protection/google-recaptcha>` "
"ščitita obrazce spletnih mest pred nezaželeno pošto in zlorabo. Poskušata "
"razlikovati med človeškimi in botovskimi prispevki z uporabo neinteraktivnih "
"izzivov, ki temeljijo na telemetriji in obnašanju obiskovalcev."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:11
msgid ""
"We recommend using **Cloudflare Turnstile**, as reCAPTCHA v3 may not be "
"compliant with local data protection regulations."
msgstr ""
"Priporočamo uporabo **Cloudflare Turnstile**, saj reCAPTCHA v3 morda ni v "
"skladu z lokalnimi predpisi o varstvu podatkov."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:15
msgid ""
"All pages using the :guilabel:`Form`, :guilabel:`Newsletter Block`, "
"or :guilabel:`Newsletter Popup` snippets are protected by both tools."
msgstr ""
"Vse strani, ki uporabljajo delčke :guilabel:`Obrazec`, :guilabel:`Blok e-"
"novic` ali :guilabel:`Pojavno okno e-novic`, so zaščitene z obema orodjema."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:19
msgid ""
"`Cloudflare Turnstile's documentation <https://developers.cloudflare.com/"
"turnstile/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Dokumentacija Cloudflare Turnstile <https://developers.cloudflare.com/"
"turnstile/>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Google's reCAPTCHA v3 guide <https://developers.google.com/recaptcha/docs/"
"v3>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Vodnik za Google reCAPTCHA v3 <https://developers.google.com/recaptcha/docs/"
"v3>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:25
msgid "Cloudflare Turnstile configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija Cloudflare Turnstile"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:30
msgid "On Cloudflare"
msgstr "Na Cloudflare"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:32
msgid ""
"`Create <https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up>`_ or `log in <https://"
"dash.cloudflare.com/login>`_ to a Cloudflare account."
msgstr ""
"`Ustvarite <https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up>`_ ali `se prijavite "
"<https://dash.cloudflare.com/login>`_ v račun Cloudflare."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:34
msgid ""
"In the dashboard's navigation sidebar, go to :menuselection:`Application "
"security --> Turnstile`."
msgstr ""
"V stranski vrstici za krmarjenje nadzorne plošče pojdite "
"na :menuselection:`Varnost aplikacije --> Turnstile`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:35
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Overview` page, click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add "
"widget`."
msgstr ""
"Na strani :guilabel:`Pregled` kliknite :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Dodaj "
"pripomoček`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:36
msgid "Add a :guilabel:`Widget name` to easily identify it."
msgstr "Dodajte :guilabel:`Ime pripomočka`, da ga lahko preprosto prepoznate."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:37
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add Hostnames`, enter a custom hostname "
"(e.g., *example.com* or *subdomain.example.com*), then click :guilabel:`Add` "
"twice."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Dodaj gostitelje`, vnesite ime "
"gostitelja po meri (npr. *example.com* ali *subdomain.example.com*) in nato "
"dvakrat kliknite :guilabel:`Dodaj`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:39
msgid "Select a :guilabel:`Widget Mode`:"
msgstr "Izberite :guilabel:`Način gradnika`:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:41
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Managed` mode is **recommended**, as it allows Turnstile to "
"prompt visitors to confirm they are human when necessary."
msgstr ""
"Način :guilabel:`Upravljan` je **priporočen**, saj omogoča Turnstile, da po "
"potrebi pozove obiskovalce, naj potrdijo, da so ljudje."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:0
msgid "Cloudflare Turnstile human verification widget"
msgstr "Gradnik za človeško preverjanje Cloudflare Turnstile"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:47
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`Non-interactive` and :guilabel:`Invisible` modes, "
"visitors are never prompted to interact. In :guilabel:`Non-interactive` "
"mode, a loading widget can be displayed to warn visitors that Turnstile "
"protects the form; however, the widget is not supported by Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Pri načinih :guilabel:`Neinteraktivni` in :guilabel:`Neviden` obiskovalci "
"nikoli niso pozvani k interakciji. V načinu :guilabel:`Neinteraktivni` se "
"lahko prikaže gradnik za nalaganje, ki opozori obiskovalce, da Turnstile "
"ščiti obrazec; vendar Odoo ne podpira tega gradnika."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:52
msgid ""
"If the Turnstile check fails, visitors are not able to submit the form, and "
"the following error message is displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Če preverjanje Turnstile ne uspe, obiskovalci ne morejo oddati obrazca in "
"prikaže se naslednje sporočilo o napaki:"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:0
msgid "Cloudflare Turnstile verification error message"
msgstr "Sporočilo o napaki preverjanja Cloudflare Turnstile"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:58
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/pages.rst:28
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`Create`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:60
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:101
msgid ""
"The generated keys are then displayed. Leave the page open for convenience, "
"as copying the keys in Odoo is required next."
msgstr ""
"Generirani ključi so nato prikazani. Pustite stran odprto za priročnost, saj "
"je treba ključe v naslednjem koraku kopirati v Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:64
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:105
msgid "On Odoo"
msgstr "V Odooju"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:66
msgid ""
"From the database dashboard, open the **Settings** app. "
"Under :guilabel:`Integrations`, enable :guilabel:`Cloudflare Turnstile`, "
"then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Na nadzorni plošči podatkovne zbirke odprite aplikacijo **Nastavitve**. "
"Pod :guilabel:`Integracije` omogočite :guilabel:`Cloudflare Turnstile` in "
"nato kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:68
msgid ""
"Open the :ref:`Cloudflare Turnstile <website/spam_protection/cloudflare>` "
"page, copy the :guilabel:`Site Key`, and paste it into the :guilabel:`CF "
"Site Key` field in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odprite stran :ref:`Cloudflare Turnstile <website/spam_protection/"
"cloudflare>`, kopirajte :guilabel:`Ključ spletnega mesta` in ga prilepite v "
"polje :guilabel:`CF ključ spletnega mesta` v Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:70
msgid ""
"Open the Cloudflare Turnstile page, copy the :guilabel:`Secret Key`, and "
"paste it into the :guilabel:`CF Secret Key` field in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odprite stran Cloudflare Turnstile, kopirajte :guilabel:`Skrivni ključ` in "
"ga prilepite v polje :guilabel:`CF skrivni ključ` v Odooju."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:72
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:121
#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/translate.rst:61
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Kliknite :guilabel:`Shrani`."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:75
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Application security --> Turnstile` in your "
"Cloudflare account to :guilabel:`View analytics` and access additional "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"V svojem računu Cloudflare pojdite na :menuselection:`Varnost aplikacije --> "
"Turnstile`, da :guilabel:`Ogledate analitiko` in dostopate do dodatnih "
"nastavitev."

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:81
msgid "reCAPTCHA v3 configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija reCAPTCHA v3"

#: ../../content/applications/websites/website/configuration/spam_protection.rst:84
msgid ""
"reCAPTCHA v3 may not be compliant with local data protection regulations."
msgstr ""
